{"text": "Simpleton picked up the goose and went to an inn for the night. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The innkeeper had three daughters, and they saw the goose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Each girl wanted to take a golden feather for herself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The oldest girl touched the goose, but her hand stuck to it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The second and third girls tried, too, and they also stuck. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The next morning, Simpleton walked away with the goose under his arm. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The three girls were running behind him, but they could not let go. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In a field, a parson saw them and became angry. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Shame on you, girls, Why are you running after this young man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He took the youngest girls hand, and he stuck, too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soon the sexton and two farm workers got stuck, too.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "i", "m", "p", "l", "e", "t", "o", "n", " ", "p", "i", "c", "k", "e", "d", " ", "u", "p", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "o", "o", "s", "e", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "a", "n", " ", "i", "n", "n", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "n", "i", "g", "h", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "i", "n", "n", "k", "e", "e", "p", "e", "r", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "t", "h", "r", "e", "e", " ", "d", "a", "u", "g", "h", "t", "e", "r", "s", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "s", "a", "w", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "o", "o", "s", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "E", "a", "c", "h", " ", "g", "i", "r", "l", " ", "w", "a", "n", "t", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "a", "k", "e", " ", "a", " ", "g", "o", "l", "d", "e", "n", " ", "f", "e", "a", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "f", "o", "r", " 